# The C shim and its build description are not Python package data:
# `src/drama_studio/spatial/` deliberately has no __init__.py, because a
# package directory of that name would shadow the `drama_studio.spatial`
# module next to it. Without this file the sources reach neither the sdist nor
# the wheel, so `pip install .` from a published archive could not build the
# spatial renderer at all. The installer payload copies `src/` verbatim and is
# unaffected; wheel users get a prebuilt binary from the installer instead.
include scripts/build_spatial.py
graft src/drama_studio/spatial
